# SKILLCHECK — Hackathon Documentation

## Project Overview
SKILLCHECK is our web-based hackathon project, built and hosted using Base44.

## Problem Statement
The project explores a digital approach to a skill-related problem. The specific problem addressed is reflected in the functionality of our website.

## Solution
SKILLCHECK provides a web-based experience through its implemented features.

## Objectives
- Build and publish a website.
- Provide a simple user experience.
- Explore digital solutions to skill-related challenges.
- Learn website development, deployment, and project documentation.

## Technology Used
- **Base44:** Website building and hosting.
- **GitHub:** Project repository and documentation.

